    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CBB201427628F5B9",
      "text": "Ein Jahr und einige Monate zuvor...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "57E0AC65E5DBDD02",
      "text": "Was ist los, Pinio?[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "B7C0872A8423728D",
      "text": "Ach, Big Boss hatte ein paar Dinge mit mir zu\\nbesprechen. Das meiste wäre jetzt aber geregelt.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "4BBED119DE7A8E54",
      "text": "Was für Dinge?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "B7C0862A842370DA",
      "text": "Es ging vor allem um Operation Star... und...\\num einen Kodex fürs Team.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_04",
      "hash64": "B7C0812A8423685B",
      "text": "In letzter Zeit sind viele neue Mitglieder\\ndazugekommen, da brauchen wir so langsam\\r\\nein paar Verhaltensregeln. Einen Kodex eben.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "819E7BF70D4A4EA1",
      "text": "Ah, okay! Du wirst dir bestimmt einen tollen\\nKodex für uns ausdenken, nicht wahr, Pinio?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_05",
      "hash64": "B7C0802A842366A8",
      "text": "Ha, nein danke. Das ist mir zu viel Druck.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_06",
      "hash64": "B7C0832A84236BC1",
      "text": "Erinnert ihr euch noch daran, dass mich die\\nanderen Schüler nicht mehr leiden konnten,\\r\\nnachdem ich Schulsprecher geworden war?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "4BBED419DE7A936D",
      "text": "Klar, du hast ja auch ’nen Haufen nerviger Regeln\\naufgestellt und dir so Schüler zum Feind gemacht.\\r\\nDu wurdest sofort durch jemand anderen ersetzt.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "BCA702EC8213097E",
      "text": "Dem kann ich nur beipflichten... Per exemplum:\\n„Frisuren mit einer Haarlänge von mehr als drei\\r\\nZentimetern im Nacken sind verboten.“\\c\\nEure Regeln waren ein pures Ärgernis,\\nwerter Pinio![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_07",
      "hash64": "B7C0822A84236A0E",
      "text": "Eben! Deshalb sag ich ja, dass ich nicht für die\\nErstellung von so ’nem Kodex geeignet bin![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "57E0AB65E5DBDB4F",
      "text": "Aber du kümmerst dich doch sonst immer um die\\nTeam-Mitglieder, Pinio. Du kennst uns so gut![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "819E78F70D4A4988",
      "text": "Ja, wir haben vollstes Vertrauen in dich.\\nOhne dich wären wir aufgeschmissen![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_03",
      "hash64": "4BBED319DE7A91BA",
      "text": "Du bist nicht mehr wie damals. Wenn du jetzt\\n’nen Kodex schreibst, würde ich ihn befolgen![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "BCA701EC821307CB",
      "text": "Meine Wenigkeit würde ebenfalls einwilligen![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_08",
      "hash64": "B7C07D2A8423618F",
      "text": "Okay, okay, Leute, ich hab’s kapiert.\\nIch werd uns diesen Kodex zusammenstellen...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_09",
      "hash64": "B7C07C2A84235FDC",
      "text": "Ich habe getan... was ich konnte...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_10",
      "hash64": "B7BCFF2A8420559E",
      "text": "Ja, das war’s... Ich muss dem Kodex folgen,\\nhab ihn schließlich selbst verfasst. Dann sind\\r\\nmeine Tage als Boss wohl gezählt...\\c\\nHier, mein Teamorden, das Zeichen meines\\nBoss-Status. Nimm schon.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 198,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "1BC1335191082461",
      "text": "Und wo wir schon mal dabei sind, diese TM hast\\ndu dir auch verdient.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
