    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "141F57B4A3D0E657",
      "text": "He, bist du Pinio?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_16",
      "hash64": "B7BD012A84205904",
      "text": "Woah! Noch ein ungebetener Gast? Was soll die\\nSchmalzlocke? Hat die ein Fuentente gestylt?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "141F58B4A3D0E80A",
      "text": "Ich wollte dich nur kurz was fragen.\\nWär das okay?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_17",
      "hash64": "B7BD022A84205AB7",
      "text": "Boah, das wird garantiert nervig, aber okay.\\nHab ja jetzt eh nichts Besseres mehr zu tun...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
